digraph account_payable_process_196 {
	graph [rankdir=LR]
	START_NODE [label="" shape=circle width=0.3]
	subgraph CLUSTER_0 {
		"send to the vendor accounting department" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" [shape=box]
		"send to the vendor accounting department" -> "create a receiving report"
		"gather the receiving report" [shape=box]
		"create a receiving report" -> "gather the receiving report"
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1I50" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"gather the receiving report" -> "AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1I50"
		"schedule the payment" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1I50" -> "schedule the payment"
		"stamp all documents" [shape=box]
		"AND_SPLIT--4. Payment_1I50" -> "stamp all documents"
		"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1I50" [label="+" fixedsize=true shape=diamond width=0.5]
		"schedule the payment" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1I50"
		"stamp all documents" -> "AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1I50"
	}
	START_NODE -> "send to the vendor accounting department"
	END_NODE [label="" shape=doublecircle width=0.2]
	"AND_JOIN--4. Payment_1I50" -> END_NODE
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following text is about the account payable process. It begins when you send to the vendor accounting department. 
When sending to the vendor accounting department is completed, creating a receiving report needs to be done. 
Once creating a receiving report occurs, gathering the receiving report should be done. 
After gathering the receiving report, the next tasks should be scheduling the payment and stamping all documents, they should be done in parallel. 
The process is now completed. 
"
	fontsize=15 label="\n\n
The following is about the account payable process. It begins when you send your invoice to the vendor accounting department.
When the invoice sent to the vendor accounting department is completed, a receiving report needs to be created.
Once a receipt report is created, capturing the receipt report should be done.
After collecting the receiving report, the next task should be coordinating the payment and stamping all documents. These should be done in parallel.
The process is now finished.
"
}
